# Pulse redesign (mandatory)

Read `docs/redesign/GLOBAL-RULES.md` before UI work, and match `docs/redesign/design/screens` exactly. Never invent design.

- Boards: `docs/redesign/design/screens/*.jpg` (desktop 1440×900, mobile 390×844); structure, copy and states in `design/reference/*.dc.html`.
- CSS: `newsplus-front/src/styles/design/` (np4 / npm2 / npx, ported as-is). UI kit: `newsplus-front/src/ui/`.
- No Tailwind, no `brand-*` / `nd-*` / `.theme-tools` classes, no Nothing styles: the hybrid system was removed in S10.
- Visual QA: `node docs/redesign/qa-tools/shots.mjs <sprint|all>` with the dev server running.
